Baton Rouge, LA · Hybrid (2 days in office) · Full-time · $95,000 – $120,000

About us
Pelican Path Health builds a patient-scheduling app used by 40 rural clinics across Louisiana. Our small team ships to iOS and Android from one Flutter codebase.

What you''ll do
- Build and maintain features in our Flutter app, from design hand-off in Figma to App Store and Google Play release.
- Own state management with Riverpod and keep our offline-first appointment cache reliable.
- Integrate with our Firebase backend (Auth, Firestore, Cloud Messaging for push notifications).
- Write widget and unit tests and keep our Codemagic CI pipeline green.

Required
- 2+ years building production apps with Flutter and Dart.
- Experience with a state management approach (Riverpod or Bloc).
- Experience consuming REST APIs.
- Comfortable with Git and code review.

Nice to have
- Firebase (Auth, Firestore, push notifications).
- Native iOS (Swift) or Android (Kotlin) experience.
- Accessibility (WCAG) experience.
- Healthcare or HIPAA-regulated work.

Visa sponsorship is not available for this role.
