Houston, TX · Remote or hybrid · Full-time · $140,000 – $175,000

Pelican Path Health builds models that flag anomalies in hospital lab results for clinician review.

Responsibilities
- Train, evaluate, and ship classification models with PyTorch and scikit-learn.
- Build retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) tools over clinical guidelines using LLM APIs and a vector database.
- Productionize models with MLflow, Docker, and FastAPI on Google Cloud.

Required
- 3+ years of Python.
- 2+ years of machine learning in production.
- PyTorch or TensorFlow.
- scikit-learn and Pandas.
- SQL.
- Statistics fundamentals.

Preferred
- Large language models and prompt engineering.
- Vector databases (pgvector, Pinecone).
- MLOps tooling (MLflow, Kubeflow).
- Google Cloud.
- HIPAA or healthcare data experience.

We sponsor visas.
